{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1406656-strange-shades-mekhet-now-available-at-storytellers-vault","id":1406656,"title":"Strange Shades: Mekhet Now Available at Storytellers Vault","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-06T12:29:12-07:00","id":1406656,"title":"Strange Shades: Mekhet Now Available at Storytellers Vault","content":"So, uh, this isn't Bloodlines: The Ageless, but I think you'll like it?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/323224/Strange-Shades-Mekhet\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...-Shades-Mekhet</a> <div align=\"center\">We\u2019ve met before.</div> <div align=\"center\">When?</div> <div align=\"center\">Whenever you heard a whisper in an empty room.<br /> Whenever a shadow didn\u2019t seem human, but watched you all the same.<br /> Whenever a book fell from a shelf and opened to a page that began with your name.</div> <div align=\"center\">Well, that one time.</div> <div align=\"center\">To answer your next question: Yes, I saw.</div> <div align=\"center\">And it will cost you.</div> <div align=\"center\">\u2014 Jackie Kilpatrick, Mnemosyne wholesaler</div> <br /> Weird and wise among the Kindred, the Mekhet know the All Night Society\u2019s dirtiest secrets \u2014 but they can\u2019t keep them forever. Now, for the first time in more than a decade, shine a light on the Clan of Shadows.<br /> <b>Strange Shades</b> is an update and expansion of the first edition supplement<b> Shadows in the Dark: Mekhet</b>. It includes:<ul><li>Seven Shadow bloodlines: The Csal\u00e1d, Kuufukuji, Mnemosyne, Norvegi, and Qedeshah, re-imagined for modern nights, as well as the Byronic Leandros and the tech-bound Connected.</li> <li>A Shadow Cult revival, delving into the elaborate conspiracies Mekhet use to dupe their victims. Revisit old friends in the Followers of Seth and the Moulding Room, and meet new ones among the Inconnu, disciples of the living Masquerade.</li> <li>Three Night Horror entries to provoke and support your Shadow characters.</li> <li>New Devotions, Merits, banes, and other tools for players and Storytellers alike!</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> Now, to drink.<br /> <br /> PS: If you purchase, please consider leaving a review. It's really helpful!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 08-06-2020, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-06T12:48:14-07:00","id":1406659,"title":"","content":"Well, that looks very interest