ankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T13:36:46-07:00","id":1419216,"title":"","content":"Hey all, DTRPG is having its annual Halloween sale! <b>Strange Shades </b>is going for 25% off, as well as our bloodlines conversion books, <b>Devoted </b>and <b>Resurrected</b>, the latter of which has a fancy new cover:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/323224/Strange-Shades-Mekhet\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/323224.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/323224/Strange-Shades-Mekhet\" target=\"_blank\"> Strange Shades: Mekhet - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/323224/Strange-Shades-Mekhet\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/323224/Strange-Shades-Mekhet </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Strange Shades: Mekhet - We&rsquo;ve met before. When? Whenever you heard a whisper in an empty room. Whenever a shadow didn&rsquo;t seem human but watch </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/301087/Bloodlines-The-Devoted\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/301087.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/301087/Bloodlines-The-Devoted\" target=\"_blank\"> Bloodlines: The Devoted - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/301087/Bloodlines-The-Devoted\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/301087/Bloodlines-The-Devoted </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Bloodlines: The Devoted - We plot our intrigues in the dark,pretending the All Night Society works as the day. But politics are just a game to kee </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/281799/Bloodlines-The-Resurrected\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/281799.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/281799/Bloodlines-The-Resurrected\" target=\"_blank\"> Bloodlines: The Resurrected - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/281799/Bloodlines-The-Resurrected\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/281799/Bloodlines-The-Resurrected </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Bloodlines: The Resurrected - The Blood changes. It finds new veins,it pumps through fresh hearts. It gets smarter. And old blood? It never stops lear </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Sales are when we STV authors get a lot of revenue, so if you're bought these already (and you like them!), consider passing around the links; any little bit makes doing these books more sustainable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Cai